  "details": "The UCPD and CRD are part of EU law, and VRChat has EU customers (and therefore must comply with it legally speaking).\n\nRecently, the Consumer Protection Cooperation (CPC) Network published guidelines intended to make it very clear to companies how to comply with these laws.\n\nThey are summarized here: \n\nhttps://natlawreview.com/article/eu-new-european-consumer-protection-guidelines-virtual-currencies-video-games\n\nThis is a request to ensure VRChat marketplaces comply with this, in particular:\n\n * showing real currency in store\n\n * allowing purchasing credits at the exact price required\n\n * 14 day refund windows",
